      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VendorFlow setup\n**Spreadsheet needs 2 tabs**\n1. `Purchase Orders`: PO ID | Material | Supplier | Supplier Email | Delivery Date | Status | Follow-up Status | Reminder Count | Last Reminder Date | Escalated | Escalated Date\n2. `Follow-up History`: Date | PO ID | Material | Supplier | Action | Days Overdue | Sent To\n\n**Rules (edit in the Code node)**\n- Pending + past delivery date = overdue\n- 1-2 days overdue: one reminder to supplier\n- 3+ days overdue: one escalation to manager\n- Reminder Count / Escalated columns stop repeat emails\n\n**To do:** connect Google Sheets + Gmail, pick the spreadsheet in all 3 sheet nodes, set the manager email.",
